<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 338)</h2>
<p><b>Reloading the review page no longer loses its place.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>A browser seat that reloads (or rejoins under the same name) now receives the full join snapshot again — it opens on the frame the room is parked on instead of frame 0. This affected every page reload.</li>
</ul>
